                "title": "3 Inch x 2 Inch Solid Brass Cabinet Hinge, Pair, Deltana CH3020",
                "description": "Deltana CH3020 Cabinet Hinge - Made out of solid brass, this Deltana made cabinet hinge is constructed to last. It measures 3 inches high and 2 inches wide. Sold as a pair, the Deltana CH3020 full mortise lightweight door hinge comes packaged with matching solid brass Phillips flathead screws #7x3/4 inch. The ball tip finials come standard but they can easily be interchanged by any of the Deltana cabinet finials.",
